  "worked_solution": "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(u+v)=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061u\\operatorname{cos}\u2061v+\\operatorname{cos}\u2061u\\operatorname{sin}\u2061v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{7\\pi }{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sin\\,(x+\\frac{7\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\frac{7\\pi }{4}+\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x\\operatorname{sin}\u2061\\frac{7\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
